WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.803
-President Trump confessed on TV
to the thing

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.606
he's being investigated for,
and on top of that,

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:09.142
he managed to drag Vice
President Mike Pence into it.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:12.011
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:15.614
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:18.684
First, let's just remember the
central issue at question here.

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:21.320
Trump had a phone call
with the president of Ukraine

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.823
during which he dangled
hundreds of millions of dollars

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.125
in military aid
and in return asked him

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.895
to dig up dirt on a political
opponent, Joe Biden,

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.763
by literally telling
the president of Ukraine,

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:33.766
"I would like you
to do us a favor."

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.436
That is extortion
and a flagrant abuse of power.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.238
And as we said before, you never
want to do Trump a favor

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:40.639
because then he'll befriend you

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:42.875
and then humiliate you
on national television.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.611
I mean, yesterday, all
the president of Finland did

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.947
was sit next to him
in the Oval Office

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.749
while Trump descended
into madness,

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.251
and at one point, when Trump
tried to get close to him

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:53.819
by putting a hand on his leg,

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:57.457
the president of Finland
literally had to swat him away.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:58.691
-Finland is the happiest country
in the world.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.193
-Finland is a happy country.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:02.195
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:05.297
-That is...

00:01:05.297 --> 00:01:09.268
That is like...

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.904
That is like when you
get in a fight with your wife

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:15.875
on the drive to a dinner party,
and then when you sit down,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.677
you try to act
like it didn't happen

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.947
but she wants you to know
she hasn't forgotten.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:24.417
"Isn't that right, honey?"
"Get your hand off of me.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.587
We will talk about this
when we get home."

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.455
In fact, during that
whole press conference,

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.591
the president of Finland
was turning to the cameras

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.793
and pleading for help
like Mr. Roper

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:38.031
when Mrs. Roper gets horny.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:42.535
Now, as you'll recall, Trump
has lashed out at accusations

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.337
that he did anything wrong
on the call

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:45.705
with the president of Ukraine,

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.407
insisting there was
no quid pro quo

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.242
and that he did not pressure
Ukraine to investigate Biden.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:53.913
-There was no quid pro quo.
There was nothing.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:56.115
It was a perfect conversation.

00:01:56.115 --> 00:02:00.386
There was absolutely
no pressure put on him.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:03.722
There was no quid pro quo.
At all.

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:05.290
There was no pressure.
No nothing.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.325
There was no pressure.

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:08.127
Uh, that was not pressure.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:11.830
I know when I give pressure.
And that was not pressure.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:15.501
-What does that mean?
"I know when I give pressure"?

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:17.369
Trump's only defense is,

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:20.873
"I know when I commit a crime,
and that was not a crime."

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.076
Like if the cops
knocked on your door and said,

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.244
"Did you beat a guy to death
with a tire iron,

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:26.813
chop up his body
with a chain saw,

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.481
and throw his limbs
into the river?"

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:32.785
And you said, "I didn't chop him
up. I know when I chop guys up."

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.086
You might also remember

00:02:34.086 --> 00:02:36.823
that in addition to the actual
notes from the call,

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.158
we also have
the whistleblower's complaint

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:41.127
which has been deemed
urgent and credible

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:43.029
and alleged that the President

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.764
pressured Ukrainian
President Zelensky

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:46.866
to initiate or continue
an investigation

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.668
into the activities of former
Vice President Joseph Biden

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:51.003
and his son, Hunter Biden.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:53.439
And even though we've literally
seen the call notes

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.475
and Trump has basically
admitted to doing

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.210
what the whistleblower alleges,
he also keeps calling

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.646
the whistleblower
a liar and a spy.

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.582
In fact, he even claimed that
once House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:05.885
saw the actual notes
from the call,

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.920
she changed her mind
on impeachment.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.922
-The whistleblower
was so dishonest.

00:03:09.922 --> 00:03:13.292
The whistleblower said
terrible things about the call,

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:15.761
and if you remember
at the beginning,

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:17.563
it was "quid pro quo."

00:03:17.563 --> 00:03:19.498
That's all you heard about.

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:22.068
And I think he said seven
or eight times "quid pro quo."

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:23.602
In other words,
you're gonna do that

00:03:23.602 --> 00:03:25.037
or we're not
gonna give you money.

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:26.806
You're gonna do this,
or we're not gonna --

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:29.642
Nancy Pelosi called for
essentially impeachment.

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:32.945
"Let's impeach the President."
Before she saw the transcript.

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:38.284
So when she saw that, she --
I heard she went crazy.

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:41.120
She said, "We can't impeach him
in this conversation.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.489
That's a great conversation."

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:45.291
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:50.463
-I guarantee you
she did not say that.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:52.098
At this point, he's just writing

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:55.868
fan fiction
about Nancy Pelosi now.

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:58.003
"Nancy Pelosi
walked into her office,

00:03:58.003 --> 00:04:00.138
and she read the transcript
and said,

00:04:00.138 --> 00:04:01.874
'We can't impeach him!

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.043
We can't impeach him
on this conversation.

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:06.579
That's a great conversation.'

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:09.148
And then she gazed
out the window

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:14.387
and had the same thought
that had nagged her for years.

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:18.091
Why hadn't she married someone
as handsome as Donald Trump?"

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:20.693
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:26.298
So, again, all of this --

00:04:26.298 --> 00:04:29.835
all of this is confirmed
by the call notes themselves.

00:04:29.835 --> 00:04:32.204
We already have
all the evidence.

00:04:32.204 --> 00:04:33.940
It's all there in plain sight.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.543
But yesterday, a reporter tried
to ask Trump a simple question.

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:40.245
If you weren't pressuring
the president of Ukraine

00:04:40.245 --> 00:04:41.914
to investigate Joe Biden,

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:44.149
then what were you
asking him to do?

00:04:44.149 --> 00:04:46.552
And instead of answering
that question,

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.087
Trump got mad and told him

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:50.656
to talk to the president
of Finland instead.

00:04:50.656 --> 00:04:52.057
-Go ahead. Ask a question.

00:04:52.057 --> 00:04:54.327
-The question, sir, was what did
you want President Zelensky

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:58.964
to do about Vice President Biden
and his son, Hunter?

00:04:58.964 --> 00:05:00.366
-Are you talking to me?
-Yeah.

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.468
It was just a follow-up
of what I just asked you, sir.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.836
-Listen. Are you ready?

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:06.438
We have the president
of Finland. Ask him a question.

00:05:06.438 --> 00:05:07.807
-I have one for him.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:09.575
I just wanted to follow up
on the one that I asked you.

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.276
-Did you hear me?
Did you hear me?

00:05:11.276 --> 00:05:13.112
Ask him a question.
-I will.

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:15.181
-I've given you a long answer.

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:18.751
Ask this gentleman a question.
Don't be rude.

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:21.020
-He's like a teacher
telling his class

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.822
to listen to his guest speaker
on Career Day.

00:05:23.822 --> 00:05:26.325
"Look.
I know Kyle's dad is boring

00:05:26.325 --> 00:05:28.260
because he's an accountant,

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.497
but you got to ask him
a question.

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:35.701
Kyle's right there.
He's super upset about this."

00:05:35.701 --> 00:05:38.370
So, to recap, Trump said
there was to pressure,

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.640
no quid pro quo,
the whistleblower was wrong,

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:44.276
and he did not -- he did not ask
the president of Ukraine

00:05:44.276 --> 00:05:45.644
to investigate Biden.

00:05:45.644 --> 00:05:46.746
And then this morning,

00:05:46.746 --> 00:05:48.581
he told reporters
on the White House lawn

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:51.583
that he wanted Ukraine
to investigate Joe Biden.

00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:54.286
-What exactly did you hope
Zelensky would do

00:05:54.286 --> 00:05:57.155
to Hunter Biden
after your phone call?

00:05:57.155 --> 00:06:00.659
-Well, I would think that
if they were honest about it,

00:06:00.659 --> 00:06:03.595
they'd start a major
investigation into the Bidens.

00:06:03.595 --> 00:06:05.098
It's a very simple answer.

00:06:05.098 --> 00:06:07.966
They should investigate
the Bidens.

00:06:07.966 --> 00:06:12.671
I would say that President
Zelensky, if it were me,

00:06:12.671 --> 00:06:14.139
I would recommend
that they start

00:06:14.139 --> 00:06:16.909
an investigation
into the Bidens.

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:19.111
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.111 --> 00:06:22.648
-So -- So he just
confessed on TV.

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.350
After two weeks
of lying and spinning,

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.318
he just admitted
to the crime he's accused of.

00:06:26.318 --> 00:06:29.955
He basically just blew
the whistle on himself.

00:06:29.955 --> 00:06:34.960
He should have a whistle just
around his neck at all times.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.496
"Ukraine should investigate
Joe Biden."

00:06:37.496 --> 00:06:39.131
[ Whistle blows ]

00:06:39.131 --> 00:06:41.033
"Putin should find
Hillary's e-mails."

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.968
[ Whistle blows ]

00:06:42.968 --> 00:06:44.803
"I'm gonna release a sex tape."

00:06:44.803 --> 00:06:48.440
[ Whistle blows ]

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.376
So Trump has once again just
outed himself as a criminal,

00:06:51.376 --> 00:06:53.112
but as we all know,
when Trump implodes,

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.780
he doesn't just implode
on his own.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.149
He takes everyone else in
the White House down with him.

00:06:57.149 --> 00:06:58.751
Trump's like a tornado.

00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:00.486
You don't know when or where
it's going to touch down,

00:07:00.486 --> 00:07:03.823
but when it does, it's going to
suck up some cows, a few houses,

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:05.424
and maybe even a scarecrow.

00:07:05.424 --> 00:07:10.596
And we're seeing the same thing
happen in the Ukraine scandal

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:12.564
that sparked
the impeachment inquiry.

00:07:12.564 --> 00:07:15.435
For example, you might remember
last week when out of nowhere

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.236
Trump dragged
Vice President Mike Pence

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:19.138
into his mess
by telling the press

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:22.007
that Pence had also spoken
with the president of Ukraine

00:07:22.007 --> 00:07:25.244
and that they should look
at Pence's phone calls, too.

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:29.248
-I think you should ask
for V.P. Pence's conversation

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:31.517
because he had a couple
of conversations, also.

00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:33.619
I could save you a lot of time.
They were all perfect.

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:36.022
Nothing was mentioned
of any import

00:07:36.022 --> 00:07:38.090
other than congratulations.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.092
But the word is that
they're going to ask

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:42.428
for the first
phone conversation.

00:07:42.428 --> 00:07:45.464
You can have it
any time you need it.

00:07:45.464 --> 00:07:48.400
And, also,
Mike Pence's conversations,

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.904
which were I think one or two
of them -- they were perfect.

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.839
-And let me just say,
with all sincerity,

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:56.141
no one deserves to be
dragged down by Donald Trump

00:07:56.141 --> 00:07:57.509
more than Mike Pence.

00:07:57.509 --> 00:08:00.179
Although, Pence is --

00:08:00.179 --> 00:08:03.349
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:03.349 --> 00:08:05.317
Pence should have seen
this coming...

00:08:05.317 --> 00:08:07.719
when Trump tried to give him
a "Godfather" kiss

00:08:07.719 --> 00:08:10.156
at the RNC in 2016.

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:13.626
"Come here, Fredo.
Come here, Fredo."

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:15.294
[ Laughter ]

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:17.396
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:25.171
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:28.140
And then after Trump
dragged Pence into his mess,

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.276
you'll never guess
what happened.

00:08:30.276 --> 00:08:32.244
"The Washington Post"
did some reporting,

00:08:32.244 --> 00:08:34.313
and it turns out
Pence also had a phone call

00:08:34.313 --> 00:08:36.782
with the president of Ukraine
where he discussed cutting off

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:38.917
the hundreds of millions
of dollars in military aid

00:08:38.917 --> 00:08:41.520
that Trump had dangled
as part of his quid pro quo.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.889
-"The Washington Post"
reports President Trump

00:08:43.889 --> 00:08:46.525
repeatedly involved
Vice President Pence in his plan

00:08:46.525 --> 00:08:49.295
to exert pressure on
the new president of Ukraine.

00:08:49.295 --> 00:08:52.197
Trump used the Vice President
to inform the Ukrainian leader

00:08:52.197 --> 00:08:54.366
that hundreds of millions
of dollars in U.S. aid

00:08:54.366 --> 00:08:56.902
was still being withheld.

00:08:56.902 --> 00:08:58.704
-Well, Mike Pence,
you can't be surprised

00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:00.772
that the ass [bleep]
you pledged your loyalty to

00:09:00.772 --> 00:09:02.541
is now throwing you
under the bus.

00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:04.576
This isn't a case
of the carriage turning

00:09:04.576 --> 00:09:07.213
back into a pumpkin, because
he's always been a pumpkin.

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:08.915
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:08.915 --> 00:09:10.382
And on top of that,
on top of that,

00:09:10.382 --> 00:09:13.452
White House sources are clearly
leaking to "The Washington Post"

00:09:13.452 --> 00:09:16.288
that Pence was involved
so they can dirty him up, too.

00:09:16.288 --> 00:09:18.291
I love imagining
how this is all playing out.

00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:20.259
Pence coming home
from a hard day's work

00:09:20.259 --> 00:09:22.961
of trying to blend in with the
background during meetings,

00:09:22.961 --> 00:09:25.130
flicking on the lights,
and the house is empty

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.199
except for Trump
sitting there in the corner

00:09:27.199 --> 00:09:29.368
with his back turned.

00:09:29.368 --> 00:09:31.370
"Ohh.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.639
Hello, Mike.

00:09:33.639 --> 00:09:35.874
Weren't expecting me, were you?
Oh, you're in trouble, Mike.

00:09:35.874 --> 00:09:38.744
It's all --
It's all here in this note.

00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:41.947
I know what you did last summer
because I did it, too."

00:09:41.947 --> 00:09:43.916
[ Laughter ]

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:45.818
In fact, if you read --

00:09:45.818 --> 00:09:48.220
if you read this
"Washington Post" article,

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.689
you can almost see,
line by line, Pence's aides

00:09:50.689 --> 00:09:52.424
trying to claim he's innocent

00:09:52.424 --> 00:09:54.060
and White House aides
claiming he's guilty.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.128
Pence's aides, for example,
say they didn't know anything

00:09:56.128 --> 00:09:58.063
about Trump's efforts to
pressure Ukraine's president

00:09:58.063 --> 00:09:59.565
to investigate Biden.

00:09:59.565 --> 00:10:02.201
Officials close to Pence
insist he was unaware

00:10:02.201 --> 00:10:04.369
of Trump's efforts
to press Zelensky

00:10:04.369 --> 00:10:06.505
for damaging information
about Biden and his son.

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:07.906
All right, I'm sorry,
but that's just insane.

00:10:07.906 --> 00:10:09.108
Of course Pence knew about it.

00:10:09.108 --> 00:10:10.543
You think Trump
kept this a secret?

00:10:10.543 --> 00:10:12.477
The guy can't keep his mouth
shut about anything.

00:10:12.477 --> 00:10:14.847
He probably ran over to Pence's
office immediately to tell him

00:10:14.847 --> 00:10:16.482
about it just like a kid
who figured out

00:10:16.482 --> 00:10:18.284
how to type "BOOBS"
on a calculator.

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:21.086
"Mike! Mike, look.

00:10:21.086 --> 00:10:24.190
Do you see, Mike?

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.624
Mike.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:29.362
Mike. Mike.

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:31.530
Mike.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.399
Do you see?"

00:10:33.399 --> 00:10:36.969
[ Laughter ]

00:10:36.969 --> 00:10:39.872
So, obviously,
Pence knew what was going on,

00:10:39.872 --> 00:10:42.174
just like Trump's
Secretary of State, Mike Pompeo,

00:10:42.174 --> 00:10:45.044
who was on this call, and his
Attorney General, Bill Barr,

00:10:45.044 --> 00:10:46.979
who was named repeatedly
during the call.

00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.680
So now,
because they're all implicated

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.182
and because
they have no defense,

00:10:50.182 --> 00:10:52.184
they're just threatening to
block the impeachment inquiry

00:10:52.184 --> 00:10:53.953
all together. Trump's calling it
a treasonous coup,

00:10:53.953 --> 00:10:56.555
and Rudy Giuliani is actually
threatening to sue Congress

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:58.457
for following
the impeachment procedure

00:10:58.457 --> 00:11:00.692
laid out by the founders
in the Constitution.

00:11:00.692 --> 00:11:04.163
And if you're wondering just
how serious this lawsuit is,

00:11:04.163 --> 00:11:05.931
here's a real
text-message exchange

00:11:05.931 --> 00:11:07.866
Rudy had with a reporter
for "The Atlantic"

00:11:07.866 --> 00:11:10.002
who posted it to Twitter
on Tuesday.

00:11:10.002 --> 00:11:11.570
"What are you planning
to do next?"

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.740
"Looking at a jawsuit
to end lawless action."

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.175
"Who are you going to sue?"

00:11:16.175 --> 00:11:18.477
"The swamp.
Trump v. the swamp."

00:11:18.477 --> 00:11:22.415
"How do you sue the swamp?"
"In federal court."

00:11:22.415 --> 00:11:24.816
You know it's bad when "jawsuit"

00:11:24.816 --> 00:11:27.753
isn't even the stupidest part
of the text message.

00:11:27.753 --> 00:11:30.922
Seriously, why are these guys
so bad at spelling?

00:11:30.922 --> 00:11:33.558
Yesterday, Trump spelled "moat"
with two O's.

00:11:33.558 --> 00:11:35.528
Rudy spelled lawsuit "jawsuit."

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:36.995
In fact,
if you showed up at court

00:11:36.995 --> 00:11:38.964
and told the judge you wanted
to file a "jawsuit"

00:11:38.964 --> 00:11:40.933
against impeachment,
they would call it moot

00:11:40.933 --> 00:11:43.669
and then dismiss it
like the president of Finland.

00:11:43.669 --> 00:11:45.003
[ Laughter ]

00:11:45.003 --> 00:11:46.839
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:48.774 --> 00:11:52.177
Again, what happened here
is very simple.

00:11:52.177 --> 00:11:54.145
The President
extorted a foreign country

00:11:54.145 --> 00:11:55.547
to meddle in the 2020 election,

00:11:55.547 --> 00:11:57.382
his staff tried to cover it up,
and then they got caught,

00:11:57.382 --> 00:11:58.917
and now he's admitting to it.

00:11:58.917 --> 00:12:01.086
Several of his most senior aides
are involved, and they're

00:12:01.086 --> 00:12:02.955
threatening to obstruct
the impeachment inquiry.

00:12:02.955 --> 00:12:05.724
And, most importantly, the Vice
President is now involved, too.

00:12:05.724 --> 00:12:08.394
Trump is turning on Pence,
and all Pence can say is...

00:12:08.394 --> 00:12:12.030
-Don't be rude.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

